{"availability":"available","full":"jess-barrett/Crucidex","name":"Crucidex","description":"Letterboxd for video games. Track your library, import from Steam, write reviews, follow friends, and discover games. Built with Next.js, Supabase, and IGDB. Live at crucidex.com.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-20T22:03:43Z","updated":"2026-05-13T22:24:50Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.crucidex.com","topics":["collaborative-filtering","gaming","igdb-api","letterboxd","nextjs","postgresql","react","recommendation-engine","social-network","steam-api","supabase","tailwindcss","typescipt","vercel"],"demo":"https://www.crucidex.com/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:57.565Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:57.565Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:57.565Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:27:57.565Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Track your gaming history. Build your library. Connect with friends.","A social platform for cataloging the games you've played, sharing reviews, and discovering new titles based on what players with similar taste enjoy.","Crucidex is a Letterboxd-style social network for video games. Index your personal collection, track playtime and ratings, write reviews, follow friends to see what they're playing, and get recommendations driven by collaborative filtering."],"features":["Seamlessly import your Steam library and organize all your games in one place. Track playtime, ratings, and play status (Playing, Completed, Backlog, Shelved, Retired, Abandoned). Filter and sort across hours played,…","Express your thoughts with detailed reviews. Build your gaming profile and become a trusted voice in the community.","Send mutual friend requests, build your friends list, and watch live activity feeds — game additions, reviews, status changes, and playtime milestones — all in real time."